# Following REPORT.md section 9 in this directory creates a virtualenv and an
# extraction cache here. Neither belongs in Git: the venv is machine-specific
# and the extraction is ~5,200 files regenerated from the read-only campaign
# Zarr stores in minutes.
.venv/
extracted/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Re-running the pipeline rewrites the committed result JSON in place when the
# scripts are invoked from this directory rather than from a scratch copy.
# Track them at the report root, not here.
*.json
*.png
tables.md
H_stageA.npz
